<p>Article backstory: this thing was conceived and written within about a six-hour window. I showed it to several staff, who said it was okay, so the version I posted was actually my first draft. The original idea was that it makes you miss an idealized version of home that takes away your ability to confront the real, actual home, but that sorta got lost because I wasn't sure how to convey it. It's fairly likely that I'll revise this thing at some point.</p>

